  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2902.14 Banked allowance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.14 “Banked allowance” means an allowance that is not used to reconcile emissions in the designated year of allocation but that is carried forward into the next year and flagged in the account as banked.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.14); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
